==English==

===Etymology===
[[homesick]] (from [[home]] + [[sick]]) + [[-ness]]

===Noun===
{{en-noun|-}}

#a strong, sad [[feeling]] of [[miss]]ing one's [[home]] (and often left-behind loved ones, such as [[family]] and [[friend]]s) when physically away

